    {
      "id": "authservice-steps",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 405,
      "y": 408,
      "width": 210,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "1. Trouve tenant via client_id\n2. Vérifie secret (Argon2id)\n3. Génère JWT signé ES256:\n\n{\n  sub: tenant_id,\n  scopes: [...],\n  iat: now,\n  exp: now + 3600\n}\n\n4. Retourne access_token",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#5b21b6",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
